{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">環西班牙單車賽，馬菲比蘭第11站封王，是他今屆第三個分站冠軍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今站屬於平地衝刺賽，長153.8公里。過程中主車群有車手意外倒地，影響多位準備衝刺的選手，他們需要醫療協助。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Anq6b0TiaD1788394352.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅衫、在總成績領先的馬斯，跟隨大集團返終點，繼續坐穩榜首。即使有車手嘗試突圍，尾段都被主車群追上，黃衫的馬菲比蘭，進入最後直路留守第二，在終點前爆發，以些微優勢壓過對手，成為今站冠軍，亦是這位英國20歲新星今屆第三個分站冠軍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Bvlemsqi4R1788394341.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T00:23:55.986159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}